            "value": "Linux 沙箱不可用：%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Linux 沙箱不可用：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model answered with nothing. Try again, or choose another model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型没有给出任何回答。可以重试，或者换一个模型。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型沒有給出任何回答。可以重試，或者換一個模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model sent nothing for %@ seconds, so the turn was stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型 %@ 秒没有任何输出，本轮已停止。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型 %@ 秒沒有任何輸出，本輪已停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The official API, or any relay or local server that speaks Chat Completions. The address ends before /chat/completions, usually with /v1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方 API，或任何支持 Chat Completions 的中转与本地服务。地址写到 /chat/completions 之前，通常以 /v1 结尾。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方 API，或任何支援 Chat Completions 的中轉與本地服務。地址寫到 /chat/completions 之前，通常以 /v1 結尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same %@ call kept giving the same result, so the turn was stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一个 %@ 调用反复得到同样的结果，本轮已停止。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一個 %@ 呼叫反覆得到同樣的結果，本輪已停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tab is yours until you hand it back or close the browser; the model is kept out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接管后这个标签页归你，模型会被挡在外面，直到你交还或关掉浏览器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接管後這個標籤頁歸你，模型會被擋在外面，直到你交還或關掉瀏覽器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terminal could not start: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端没能启动：%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "終端沒能啟動：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no API key for %@. Add one in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 还没有 API 密钥，请在设置里添加。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 還沒有 API 金鑰，請在設定裡新增。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no message to answer again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有可以重新回答的消息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有可以重新回答的訊息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is nothing older than the last few messages to summarize yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除了最近几条消息，还没有可以总结的内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除了最近幾則訊息，還沒有可以摘要的內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These alarms live only in Solos; the Clock app does not show them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些闹钟只在 Solos 里，系统「时钟」app 不会显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些鬧鐘只在 Solos 裡，系統「時鐘」app 不會顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Agent Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 智能体模式"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 代理模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: the model can run commands, read and write files, browse the web and use the device. Off: plain chat, the model only answers in text. Attached images are still sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启：模型可以运行命令、读写文件、浏览网页并使用设备功能。关闭：普通聊天，模型只以文字回答。附带的图片仍会发送。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟：模型可以執行指令、讀寫檔案、瀏覽網頁並使用裝置功能。關閉：一般聊天，模型只以文字回答。附加的圖片仍會傳送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
