            "value": "唯讀"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not available. Remove it and choose the folder again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不可用。请移除后重新选择该文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法使用。請移除後重新選擇該資料夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model can read a shared folder, and change it only if you allow that. The terminal and shell cannot see these folders; the model copies files between them and the workspace.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型可以读取共享文件夹，只有你允许时才能修改。终端和 shell 看不到这些文件夹，模型会在它们和工作区之间复制文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型可以讀取共享資料夾，只有你允許時才能修改。終端機和 shell 看不到這些資料夾，模型會在它們和工作區之間複製檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a name without slashes, colons or percent signs, not starting with a dot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称不能含斜杠、冒号或百分号，也不能以点开头。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名稱不能含斜線、冒號或百分號，也不能以點開頭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another shared folder has this name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已有另一个共享文件夹使用这个名称。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已有另一個共享資料夾使用這個名稱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model sees this folder as /solos/mnt/%@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型会把这个文件夹看作 /solos/mnt/%@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型會把這個資料夾看作 /solos/mnt/%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow changes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许修改"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允許修改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: the model can read and copy files out of this folder. On: it can also write, edit and copy files into it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭：模型可以读取并复制其中的文件。开启：模型还可以写入、编辑并复制文件进去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉：模型可以讀取並複製其中的檔案。開啟：模型還可以寫入、編輯並複製檔案進去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The system does not let Solos change this folder, so it stays read-only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统不允许 Solos 修改这个文件夹，因此它保持只读。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系統不允許 Solos 修改這個資料夾，因此它保持唯讀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
