          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允許"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow access to your health data?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许访问你的健康数据？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允許存取你的健康資料？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant wants to use your health data. What it reads becomes part of the conversation and is sent to the AI service you chose in Settings, not to Solos. Allow this only if you trust that service with health data. Solos never uses health data for advertising. You can change this in Settings > Privacy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手想使用你的健康数据。它读到的内容会成为对话的一部分，并发送给你在设置里选择的 AI 服务，而不是发给 Solos。只有当你信任该服务处理健康数据时才允许。Solos 绝不会把健康数据用于广告。你可以在“设置 > 隐私”里更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手想使用你的健康資料。它讀到的內容會成為對話的一部分，並傳送給你在設定裡選擇的 AI 服務，而不是傳給 Solos。只有當你信任該服務處理健康資料時才允許。Solos 絕不會把健康資料用於廣告。你可以在「設定 > 隱私權」裡更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
