    "This is what lets you log in once and the model carry on. Clearing it logs you out of every site.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「自己登录一次、之后让模型接着用」靠的就是这些。清掉等于在所有站点退出登录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「自己登入一次、之後讓模型接著用」靠的就是這些。清掉等於在所有網站退出登入。"
          }
