    "User Agent": {},
    "Whether the model thinks before answering in this chat. Some endpoints decide by model instead; their thinking is then hidden when this is off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本对话里模型是否先思考再回答。有些接入点按模型决定是否思考；关闭时不显示它们的思考内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本對話裡模型是否先思考再回答。有些端點按模型決定是否思考；關閉時不顯示它們的思考內容。"
          }
        }
