    },
    "An MCP server gives the model more tools. Paste the mcpServers JSON from the server's README, or ask in a chat: “add this MCP server: <link>”. A server's command (npx, uvx …) runs in the Linux system, which needs what it uses installed (apk add nodejs npm).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MCP 服务器为模型提供更多工具。粘贴服务器 README 中的 mcpServers JSON，或在对话里说：“添加这个 MCP 服务器：<链接>”。服务器的命令（npx、uvx 等）在 Linux 系统中运行，需要先安装它用到的程序（apk add nodejs npm）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
