    "The mcpServers JSON from the server's README, for example {\"mcpServers\": {\"12306-mcp\": {\"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"12306-mcp\"]}}}. A command runs in the Linux system, which needs what it uses installed (apk add nodejs npm); a first start can take ten minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器 README 中的 mcpServers JSON，例如 {\"mcpServers\": {\"12306-mcp\": {\"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"12306-mcp\"]}}}。命令在 Linux 系统中运行，需要先安装它用到的程序（apk add nodejs npm）；首次启动可能需要十分钟。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器 README 中的 mcpServers JSON，例如 {\"mcpServers\": {\"12306-mcp\": {\"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"12306-mcp\"]}}}。指令在 Linux 系統中執行，需要先安裝它用到的程式（apk add nodejs npm）；首次啟動可能需要十分鐘。"
